{"action":"create","baseRevisionId":null,"changeRationale":"The previous root reported that no research programs existed. The three supplied judgments now support a coherent, durable triangle-midpoint area program with an established theorem, supporting lemmas and methods, a corrected altitude relation, and a distinct uncompleted formalization direction.","changeRef":{"artifact":"report.md","digest":"sha256:e967a536546649d8e8c990aea26769420f6c85ec79a6df718972ff79f5fc455e","section":"## Change: root"},"contentDigest":"sha256:a434b27851eecd3e8c36f0ffd678be9a204288b8602fa4f8381afd7ab9b91996","evidence":[{"digest":"sha256:427537f9898af49bb7e20230201f0ab01db5a51cccbfdb5b57c474e488b3a262","id":"sha256:427537f9898af49bb7e20230201f0ab01db5a51cccbfdb5b57c474e488b3a262","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"},{"digest":"sha256:575cfe733758035c57b6a7f7915c3e2a38a78c25f4b0c6ce026504546e4655ed","id":"sha256:575cfe733758035c57b6a7f7915c3e2a38a78c25f4b0c6ce026504546e4655ed","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"},{"digest":"sha256:ae48d86e7bd2cdc4b6c2a708194553c6c8444c7f448bd73a82f8af95b64580c3","id":"sha256:ae48d86e7bd2cdc4b6c2a708194553c6c8444c7f448bd73a82f8af95b64580c3","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"}],"facets":["topology","content","lifecycle","provenance"],"nodeId":"root","nodeType":"root","parentId":null,"recordedAtLedgerHead":"a7acd1ec3554f51b381784ff2f84663b88e9c262","reportRef":{"artifact":"report.md","digest":"sha256:e967a536546649d8e8c990aea26769420f6c85ec79a6df718972ff79f5fc455e","section":"## Node: root"},"revisionId":"sha256:4d3d99684de555c107da7cf3186a342950d6012d8a74c93e660d88b377dd76f8","revisionNumber":1,"status":"active","subjects":[{"id":"64afc12868e150370e6c56e6eeceab6b7aabe158","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":1},{"id":"4ccbe3f18db7402d31a2ef795f6ad67962ff63e3","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":2},{"id":"8bcf66bbd7777ee31f637a0a1a144535feb82ba4","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":3}],"summary":"The current state contains one established program on the four triangles induced by the side midpoints of a nondegenerate triangle. The midpoint-segment, quarter-area, equal-area, and corrected half-altitude conclusions are established. Affine, determinant, and Lean formalization remain prospective, and no active dispute is required.","title":"Research state for triangle-midpoints"}
